{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova is a science fiction, adventure, and puzzle game set in an alternate future where a deadly virus has wiped out most of humanity. In this world, the surviving population has been placed in quarantine zones based on their characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our main character, Nova, is an assistant robot working in a greenhouse quarantine area. Over the years, Nova has grown tired of performing his routine duties in the quarantine zone. His goal is to escape the zone at night while the inhabitants of the greenhouse are asleep. However, if his escape is discovered, he could get into serious trouble. To avoid suspicion, he plans to build a duplicate of himself using parts he finds in the greenhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, accompanied by our helpful assistant drone robot, we will try to collect the necessary parts without being detected. To succeed, Nova must use the components he finds wisely and coordinate tasks with his drone companion to gather all the pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, navigating the quarantine area and avoiding detection by security robots capable of disabling him will be no easy task for Nova\u00a0and\u00a0his\u00a0drone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899890?t=1768420971","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899890?t=1768420971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899890/97f8c0bf5b11fea081aeeeced96ee221670489dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768420971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899890/97f8c0bf5b11fea081aeeeced96ee221670489dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768420971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova is a science fiction, adventure, and puzzle game set in an alternate future where a deadly virus has wiped out most of humanity. In this world, the surviving population has been placed in quarantine zones based on their characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our main character, Nova, is an assistant robot working in a greenhouse quarantine area. Over the years, Nova has grown tired of performing his routine duties in the quarantine zone. His goal is to escape the zone at night while the inhabitants of the greenhouse are asleep. However, if his escape is discovered, he could get into serious trouble. To avoid suspicion, he plans to build a duplicate of himself using parts he finds in the greenhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game, accompanied by our helpful assistant drone robot, we will try to collect the necessary parts without being detected. To succeed, Nova must use the components he finds wisely and coordinate tasks with his drone companion to gather all the pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, navigating the quarantine area and avoiding detection by security robots capable of disabling him will be no easy task for Nova\u00a0and\u00a0his\u00a0drone.</p>","developers":["Hekim Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899890/6ee3e497be6b59cb952334c3233eea86107af066/header.jpg?t=1768420971","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Hekim Games\u2122. NOVA is a trademark of 